01:00:25.130 --> 01:00:25.870
Se for excluído,

01:00:25.910 --> 01:00:26.730
as notas vão junto.

01:00:27.090 --> 01:00:27.650
E aplicativos,

01:00:27.810 --> 01:00:28.750
abas, bots, conectores

01:00:28.750 --> 01:00:29.830
